  "director_notes": "Ground-targeted (destination point with a splash layout, so enemies stand in the pool round the picked spot). The splat feel comes from timing contrast: a fast ease-in fall, a one-frame burst with a tall droplet crown and a low droplet slop, a keyframed jiggle on the settling blob, and a slosh ring. The pool is a liquid-filled puddle with popping bubbles, ripples and six-way lit fumes."
